          "type": "text",
          "id": "F1iHV",
          "name": "Section note",
          "fill": "$ad-doc-muted",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": 2400,
          "content": "Carousels: 2–10 cards, each card stands alone (Meta may reorder cards, show only the first, or turn them into a slideshow). Card 1 carries the call-out. Video: hook in 0–2 s, burned-in captions inside the safe area (most watch muted; Audience Network has no caption support), ≤15 s so Stories never split it.",
